  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop capsicum, carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, season with salt and toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de548033388b05bf552a45/step-42e17200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. Add fusilli and a pinch of salt. Cook over high heat until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and transfer pasta to a baking dish.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de548033388b05bf552a45/step-a9672f10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the baking dish, add passata, herby tomato seasoning, roasted veggies, reserved pasta water and the butter and stir to combine. Season with pepper.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese and Parmesan cheese. Bake until golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de548033388b05bf552a45/step-2c2dfa20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide roast veggie pasta bake between bowls to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67de548033388b05bf552a45/step-93847e30.jpg"
    }
  ]
